# maluos-live: the live environment of the MaluOS installer medium (Phase 11
# slice 1). A server-minimal MaluOS plus what an installer needs: the live boot,
# the installer, networking on a console, the disk and hardware tools. Never
# installed on a target. The kernel, firmware and bootloaders come from the
# image profile (image/profiles/live.pkgs), not from here.
maluos-base
casper
maluos-installer
network-manager
iproute2
iputils-ping
ethtool
iw
